{
  "version": "0.2.0",
  "slug": "split-button",
  "title": "Split button",
  "group": "Actions",
  "order": 5,
  "summary": {
    "en": "A primary button joined to a chevron that opens a menu of variants of the same action (Publish, or schedule it, or publish to members only). The left part does the common thing in one press.",
    "id": "Tombol utama yang menyatu dengan chevron pembuka menu berisi varian dari aksi yang sama (Terbitkan, atau jadwalkan, atau terbitkan hanya untuk anggota). Bagian kiri menjalankan hal yang umum dalam satu tekan."
  },
  "titleId": "Split button",
  "react": false,
  "examples": {
    "en": [
      {
        "title": "Publish with variants",
        "desc": "Press the chevron or focus it and press Arrow down. The chevron turns while the menu is open.",
        "html": "<div class=\"split\">\n  <button class=\"btn btn--primary btn--md\">Publish</button>\n  <button class=\"btn btn--primary btn--md\" aria-haspopup=\"menu\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-label=\"More publish options\" data-lds-menu=\"split-publish\"><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">expand_more</span></button>\n  <div class=\"menu menu--right\" id=\"split-publish\" role=\"menu\" style=\"top: calc(100% + 6px); right: 0;\">\n    <button class=\"menu__item\" role=\"menuitem\"><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">schedule_send</span>Schedule for later</button>\n    <button class=\"menu__item\" role=\"menuitem\"><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">group</span>Publish to members only</button>\n    <div class=\"menu__sep\" role=\"separator\"></div>\n    <button class=\"menu__item\" role=\"menuitem\"><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">draft</span>Save as draft</button>\n  </div>\n</div>"
      },
      {
        "title": "Default size",
        "desc": "The same pattern at 44 px, next to its secondary. Only the primary (and danger) variants are drawn for a split; the chevron edge uses their tone.",
        "html": "<div class=\"docs-row\">\n  <button class=\"btn btn--secondary\">Cancel</button>\n  <div class=\"split\">\n    <button class=\"btn btn--primary\">Export PDF</button>\n    <button class=\"btn btn--primary\" aria-haspopup=\"menu\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-label=\"Other export formats\" data-lds-menu=\"split-export\"><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">expand_more</span></button>\n    <div class=\"menu menu--right\" id=\"split-export\" role=\"menu\" style=\"top: calc(100% + 6px); right: 0;\">\n      <button class=\"menu__item\" role=\"menuitem\"><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">description</span>Export CSV</button>\n      <button class=\"menu__item\" role=\"menuitem\"><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">receipt_long</span>Print payment receipt</button>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>"
      }
    ],
    "id": [
      {
        "title": "Terbitkan dengan varian",
        "desc": "Tekan chevron atau fokuskan lalu tekan panah bawah. Chevron berputar selama menu terbuka.",
        "html": "<div class=\"split\">\n  <button class=\"btn btn--primary btn--md\">Terbitkan</button>\n  <button class=\"btn btn--primary btn--md\" aria-haspopup=\"menu\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-label=\"Opsi terbit lainnya\" data-lds-menu=\"split-publish\"><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">expand_more</span></button>\n  <div class=\"menu menu--right\" id=\"split-publish\" role=\"menu\" style=\"top: calc(100% + 6px); right: 0;\">\n    <button class=\"menu__item\" role=\"menuitem\"><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">schedule_send</span>Jadwalkan nanti</button>\n    <button class=\"menu__item\" role=\"menuitem\"><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">group</span>Terbitkan hanya untuk anggota</button>\n    <div class=\"menu__sep\" role=\"separator\"></div>\n    <button class=\"menu__item\" role=\"menuitem\"><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">draft</span>Simpan sebagai draf</button>\n  </div>\n</div>"
      },
      {
        "title": "Ukuran bawaan",
        "desc": "Pola yang sama pada 44 px, di samping tombol secondary-nya. Hanya varian primary (dan danger) yang dirancang untuk split; tepi chevron memakai nadanya.",
        "html": "<div class=\"docs-row\">\n  <button class=\"btn btn--secondary\">Batal</button>\n  <div class=\"split\">\n    <button class=\"btn btn--primary\">Ekspor PDF</button>\n    <button class=\"btn btn--primary\" aria-haspopup=\"menu\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-label=\"Format ekspor lain\" data-lds-menu=\"split-export\"><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">expand_more</span></button>\n    <div class=\"menu menu--right\" id=\"split-export\" role=\"menu\" style=\"top: calc(100% + 6px); right: 0;\">\n      <button class=\"menu__item\" role=\"menuitem\"><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">description</span>Ekspor CSV</button>\n      <button class=\"menu__item\" role=\"menuitem\"><span class=\"ic\" aria-hidden=\"true\">receipt_long</span>Cetak bukti pembayaran</button>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>"
      }
    ]
  },
